<p>You root yourself into the earth, and transform your flesh into stone.  While this spell is sustained, you may not move, and any forced movement will end the effect.</p><p>Your stone form and your affinity with the earth while the spell is active has the following effects:</p><ul><li> Reduces the cooldown of Earthen Missiles, Pulverizing Auger, Earthquake, and Mudslide by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 24%, 30%, 34%, 37%.</acronym></li><li> Grants <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">46%, 62%, 75%, 85%, 95%</acronym> Fire Resistance, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">28%, 38%, 46%, 52%, 58%</acronym> Lightning Resistance, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">11%, 14%, 17%, 20%, 22%</acronym> Acid Resistance, and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 20%, 30%, 40%, 50%</acronym> Stun Resistance.</li></ul><p>Resistances scale with your Spellpower.</p>